flowchart LR
    IFC[Local IFC] --> A[IFC adapter]
    H[Future host-specific adapters] -.-> A
    A --> B[BIM snapshot and takeoff]
    B --> K[Construction knowledge]
    C[Local reference providers] --> K
    K --> E[Engineering estimation]
    C --> E
    U[Planner inputs and approvals] --> K
    U --> P[CPM and CP-SAT planning]
    E --> P
    B --> R[Revision comparison]
    R --> K
    R --> P
    P --> V[Cost and carbon evaluation]
    C --> V
    V --> O[Scenario selection]
    O --> X[IFC4D export]
    E -. "Future approval required" .-> M[Optional duration correction]
    M -.-> P
    B --> S[Local versioned evidence store]
    V --> S
    P --> S
    S --> UI[Local application]

